{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111220","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1211122001:0":{"text":"ここにある漂流ボトルの中身は、どれも私たちが経験してきた事ではありませんか？","source_cn":"这些漂流瓶里的画卷，好像都是我们经历过的事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B65ACE0EC6D3BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211122002:0":{"text":"シンドバッドさんも何か絵を見つけましたか？","source_cn":"辛巴达，你也找到了瓶中画吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AD64A3ED67DE9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211122003:0":{"text":"ああ……オヤジの後ろ姿が描かれた絵だ。最後の航海に出かけてったオヤジの……","source_cn":"是的……画面上那个背影，一看就是我老爹，在他走的那天。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2D8AF3CA608A801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211122004:0":{"text":"あの背中は一生忘れねぇ……けど、これは俺しか知らない記憶のはずだ。","source_cn":"我永远记得他留给我的背影……这是独属于我的记忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82C66B84B7324AD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211122005:0":{"text":"ソニアさんは？","source_cn":"索尼娅呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x199A2ADEF29025D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t